#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to request an IBM Quantum Classroom Account and set it up for your users"
msgstr "Cara memohon Akaun Bilik Darjah IBM Quantum dan menyediakannya untuk pengguna anda"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Classroom Account"
msgstr "Buat Akaun Bilik Darjah"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Classroom Account {#create-a-classroom-account}"
msgstr "Buat Akaun Bilik Darjah {#create-a-classroom-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Quantum&reg; Classroom Account is a simple way for educators to set up and manage access for their students to use IBM Quantum hardware under the Open Plan, without the need to enter credit card information. The Open Plan provides 10 minutes of quantum processing unit (QPU) usage per 28-day rolling window.\n"
msgstr "Akaun Bilik Darjah IBM Quantum&reg; ialah cara mudah bagi pendidik untuk menyediakan dan mengurus akses untuk pelajar mereka menggunakan perkakasan IBM Quantum di bawah Pelan Terbuka, tanpa perlu memasukkan maklumat kad kredit. Pelan Terbuka menyediakan 10 minit penggunaan unit pemprosesan kuantum (QPU) setiap tetingkap bergolek 28 hari.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submit a request {#submit-a-request}"
msgstr "Hantar permohonan {#submit-a-request}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fill out [this form](https://ibm.biz/classroom-account) to submit a request for a Classroom Account.\n"
msgstr "Isi [borang ini](https://ibm.biz/classroom-account) untuk menghantar permohonan bagi Akaun Bilik Darjah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Approved Classroom Account applicants will receive an email that contains a 32-digit feature code, which you will need during the activation process below.\n"
msgstr "Pemohon Akaun Bilik Darjah yang diluluskan akan menerima e-mel yang mengandungi kod ciri 32-digit, yang anda perlukan semasa proses pengaktifan di bawah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Don't forget to submit your account ID\">\n"
"If you are approved for a Classroom Account, do not delete the confirmation email you receive. In addition to the feature code, it also contains instructions for submitting your new account ID back to the IBM Quantum team so that the account can be activated. **Classroom Accounts will not be activated without this final step.**\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Jangan lupa untuk menghantar ID akaun anda\">\n"
"Jika anda diluluskan untuk Akaun Bilik Darjah, jangan padam e-mel pengesahan yang anda terima. Selain kod ciri, ia juga mengandungi arahan untuk menghantar semula ID akaun baharu anda kepada pasukan IBM Quantum supaya akaun tersebut dapat diaktifkan. **Akaun Bilik Darjah tidak akan diaktifkan tanpa langkah terakhir ini.**\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate the account {#activate-the-account}"
msgstr "Aktifkan akaun {#activate-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Approved Classroom Account applicants will receive an email that contains a 32-digit feature code. Do not delete this email; it contains important information for submitting your new account ID once you've set up your account, which is a required step to complete the activation. \n"
msgstr "Pemohon Akaun Bilik Darjah yang diluluskan akan menerima e-mel yang mengandungi kod ciri 32-digit. Jangan padam e-mel ini; ia mengandungi maklumat penting untuk menghantar ID akaun baharu anda selepas anda menyediakan akaun anda, yang merupakan langkah wajib untuk melengkapkan pengaktifan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you have a feature code, follow the activation steps below:\n"
msgstr "Setelah anda mempunyai kod ciri, ikuti langkah pengaktifan di bawah:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Do not enter credit card details\">\n"
"When creating an account with a feature code, do not provide credit card information on IBM Cloud&reg; unless you are actively upgrading to a paid account and are willing to accept being billed for consumed services.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Jangan masukkan butiran kad kredit\">\n"
"Apabila membuat akaun dengan kod ciri, jangan berikan maklumat kad kredit pada IBM Cloud&reg; melainkan anda secara aktif menaik taraf kepada akaun berbayar dan sanggup menerima bil untuk perkhidmatan yang digunakan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visit https://cloud.ibm.com/.\n"
msgstr "Layari https://cloud.ibm.com/.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Create account**. You must create a new account even if you have a personal IBM Cloud account, because the Classroom Account is not attached to your personal account.\n"
msgstr "Klik **Create account**. Anda mesti membuat akaun baharu walaupun anda mempunyai akaun peribadi IBM Cloud, kerana Akaun Bilik Darjah tidak dilampirkan kepada akaun peribadi anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter a valid email address and a password. Use an email address that is **not** associated with an existing IBM Cloud account. Click **Next**.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan alamat e-mel yang sah dan kata laluan. Gunakan alamat e-mel yang **tidak** dikaitkan dengan akaun IBM Cloud sedia ada. Klik **Next**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check your email inbox for a seven-digit verification code, then return to the account creation form. Enter that code to verify your new account.\n"
msgstr "Semak peti masuk e-mel anda untuk kod pengesahan tujuh digit, kemudian kembali ke borang pembuatan akaun. Masukkan kod tersebut untuk mengesahkan akaun baharu anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Important:** In the Personal information section, do not enter your first and last name. Instead, in the \"First name\" field, enter your institutional affiliation, and in the \"Last name\" field, enter the name of the course using the account. Enter your country or region.\n"
msgstr "**Penting:** Dalam bahagian maklumat peribadi, jangan masukkan nama pertama dan nama akhir anda. Sebaliknya, dalam medan \"First name\", masukkan gabungan institusi anda, dan dalam medan \"Last name\", masukkan nama kursus yang menggunakan akaun tersebut. Masukkan negara atau wilayah anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complete the Account notice and click **Continue**.\n"
msgstr "Lengkapkan notis Akaun dan klik **Continue**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complete the Account privacy notice and click **Continue**.\n"
msgstr "Lengkapkan notis privasi Akaun dan klik **Continue**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "At the Verify identity screen, click **Register with a code**. \n"
msgstr "Pada skrin Verify identity, klik **Register with a code**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter your 32-digit feature code from your confirmation email in the **Enter code** text box, then click **Create account**.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan kod ciri 32-digit anda daripada e-mel pengesahan anda dalam kotak teks **Enter code**, kemudian klik **Create account**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to your [account settings on IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/account) and copy the Account ID (found under Details). \n"
msgstr "Navigasi ke [tetapan akaun anda pada IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/account) dan salin ID Akaun (ditemui di bawah Details).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow the instructions in the confirmation email you received to send this ID number to the IBM Quantum team, and they will process the Classroom Account for full activation.\n"
msgstr "Ikuti arahan dalam e-mel pengesahan yang anda terima untuk menghantar nombor ID ini kepada pasukan IBM Quantum, dan mereka akan memproses Akaun Bilik Darjah untuk pengaktifan penuh.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add users {#add-users}"
msgstr "Tambah pengguna {#add-users}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, ensure you have the correct account and region selected in the account and region switchers in the[IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) header.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, pastikan anda telah memilih akaun dan wilayah yang betul dalam penukar akaun dan wilayah pada pengepala [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select [**Access management**](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) from the main menu.\n"
msgstr "Pilih [**Access management**](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) daripada menu utama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the Users tab, click \"Invite user\".\n"
msgstr "Pada tab Users, klik \"Invite user\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter the users' email addresses. You can add multiple addresses at the same time.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan alamat e-mel pengguna. Anda boleh menambah pelbagai alamat pada masa yang sama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, an instance is assigned to each new user. It is recommended to accept the default setting.\n"
msgstr "Secara lalai, satu instans ditugaskan kepada setiap pengguna baharu. Adalah disyorkan untuk menerima tetapan lalai.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    The instance name will automatically be based on the user's email address (without the `@` character and the domain name). In the \"Instance naming schema\" field, you can customize a prefix for each instance name; for example, if a student's email address is `john-doe@university.edu`, and you specify `physics-101` as the prefix for this account, the instance name will be `physics-101-john-doe`. If you don't specify a prefix, the default prefix `open-student` will be used (`open-student-john-doe`).\n"
"1. The user will receive an invitation to create an IBM Cloud account and join the instance. They will not need to enter credit card information to create their account. \n"
"1. After the user accepts the invitation and creates their account, they can navigate to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), where they will see their Classroom Account instance in the account switcher in the page header.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Nama instans akan secara automatik berdasarkan alamat e-mel pengguna (tanpa aksara `@` dan nama domain). Dalam medan \"Instance naming schema\", anda boleh menyesuaikan awalan untuk setiap nama instans; contohnya, jika alamat e-mel pelajar ialah `john-doe@university.edu`, dan anda menetapkan `physics-101` sebagai awalan untuk akaun ini, nama instans akan menjadi `physics-101-john-doe`. Jika anda tidak menetapkan awalan, awalan lalai `open-student` akan digunakan (`open-student-john-doe`).\n"
"1. Pengguna akan menerima jemputan untuk membuat akaun IBM Cloud dan menyertai instans tersebut. Mereka tidak perlu memasukkan maklumat kad kredit untuk membuat akaun mereka.\n"
"1. Selepas pengguna menerima jemputan dan membuat akaun mereka, mereka boleh menavigasi ke [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), di mana mereka akan melihat instans Akaun Bilik Darjah mereka dalam penukar akaun pada pengepala halaman.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove users {#remove-users}"
msgstr "Alih keluar pengguna {#remove-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To remove a user from a Classroom Account, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengalih keluar pengguna daripada Akaun Bilik Darjah, ikuti langkah-langkah ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the Users tab, click the three-dot menu at the end of that user's row. \n"
msgstr "Pada tab Users, klik menu tiga titik pada penghujung baris pengguna tersebut.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select Remove user. You will see a prompt to confirm that you want to remove the user from the account. Click Remove to confirm.\n"
msgstr "Pilih Remove user. Anda akan melihat gesaan untuk mengesahkan bahawa anda mahu mengalih keluar pengguna tersebut daripada akaun. Klik Remove untuk mengesahkan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage instances {#manage-instances}"
msgstr "Urus instans {#manage-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each instance provides up to 10 minutes of QPU usage per 28-day rolling window.\n"
msgstr "Setiap instans menyediakan sehingga 10 minit penggunaan QPU setiap tetingkap bergolek 28 hari.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As the Classroom Account owner, you can view all activity across all instances in the account on the [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai pemilik Akaun Bilik Darjah, anda boleh melihat semua aktiviti merentasi semua instans dalam akaun tersebut pada halaman [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Student users can see data from workloads run in their own instance. They cannot see data from any other instances.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna pelajar boleh melihat data daripada beban kerja yang dijalankan dalam instans mereka sendiri. Mereka tidak boleh melihat data daripada mana-mana instans lain.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Renew the Classroom Account {#renew-the-classroom-account}"
msgstr "Perbaharui Akaun Bilik Darjah {#renew-the-classroom-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To renew a Classroom Account that is nearing its expiration date, request a new feature code using this [renewal form](https://ibm.biz/account-renewal). \n"
msgstr "Untuk memperbaharui Akaun Bilik Darjah yang hampir tamat tempoh, mohon kod ciri baharu menggunakan [borang pembaharuan](https://ibm.biz/account-renewal) ini.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"Direct your students to the [documentation](/guides/compute-services) for details on how to use IBM Quantum Platform. Commonly used topics include the following:\n"
"- [View backend details](/guides/qpu-information)\n"
"- [Minimize job run time](/guides/minimize-time)\n"
"- [Organize and search by job tags](/guides/add-job-tags)\n"
"- [Retrieve and save job results](/guides/save-jobs)\n"
"- [Monitor or cancel a job](/guides/monitor-job)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"Arahkan pelajar anda ke [dokumentasi](/guides/compute-services) untuk butiran tentang cara menggunakan IBM Quantum Platform. Topik yang biasa digunakan termasuk yang berikut:\n"
"- [Lihat butiran backend](/guides/qpu-information)\n"
"- [Minimumkan masa jalan kerja](/guides/minimize-time)\n"
"- [Susun dan cari mengikut tag kerja](/guides/add-job-tags)\n"
"- [Dapatkan semula dan simpan hasil kerja](/guides/save-jobs)\n"
"- [Pantau atau batalkan kerja](/guides/monitor-job)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
